---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout
  title="404 — Página no encontrada | OnFire Systems"
  description="Esta página no existe o fue movida. Vuelve al inicio de OnFire Systems."
>
<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0 48px;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .nf-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
  }
  .nf-accent {
    position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); opacity: 0.08;
    width: 500px; height: 500px; background: var(--red);
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
  }
  .nf-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .nf-code {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(8rem, 20vw, 18rem);
    font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 48px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .nf-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.1s forwards;
  }
  .nf-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 32px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; }
  .nf-title {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 800; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.25s forwards;
  }
  .nf-sub {
    font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: rgba(245,245,240,0.55);
    max-width: 460px; margin-bottom: 40px;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s forwards;
  }
  .nf-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.55s forwards;
  }
  .btn-ghost {
    display: inline-block; color: var(--white);
    padding: 16px 40px; font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray2);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--white); color: var(--white); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .not-found { padding: 0 20px; }
    .nf-code { left: 20px; font-size: clamp(6rem, 30vw, 10rem); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .not-found { padding: 0 16px; }
    .nf-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .btn-ghost, .btn-primary { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

<div class="not-found">
  <div class="nf-bg"></div>
  <div class="nf-accent"></div>
  <div class="nf-code">404</div>
  <div class="nf-content">
    <p class="nf-eyebrow">Error 404</p>
    <h1 class="nf-title">Esta página<br>no existe.</h1>
    <p class="nf-sub">La dirección que buscas fue movida, eliminada o nunca existió. Puede que el enlace esté desactualizado.</p>
    <div class="nf-actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Volver al inicio →</a>
      <a href="/contacto" class="btn-ghost">Contactarnos</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
